{
 "case": "N19-EVIDENCE-NEG",
 "says": "A person founds a Team alone, renames it and closes it, then recovers the closed Team's evidence with recover_evidence purpose preserve, which commits and returns the closed team_state. After that recovery every attempt to use the Team again is refused by its owner with team_terminal and writes nothing: a new rename (team.profile.set), a restore (team.lifecycle.apply restore), and new work that continues the renamed profile's change as archived work (continue_archived naming the rename's stored profile). A recovery whose purpose is reopen has no spelling and is refused at admission. A final team.state.read at the recovery's head still returns the closed team_state and the renamed profile: no refused step returns a record, and no team_state other than closed is written.",
